Error [jet.UseAfterMove]: `r` was consumed by `keep`, so it can't be used here
  --> tests/ui/loop_resource_move_next_iteration.jet:16:14
    |
 16 |         keep(r)
    |              ^
  --> tests/ui/loop_resource_move_next_iteration.jet:16:14
    |
 16 |         keep(r)
    |              ^ `r` moved to `keep` here on an earlier loop iteration
 Why: After a value moves somewhere else, its old name no longer gives access to it
 Fix: Stop using `r` after the move, or give `keep` a copy with `r.copy()` where it moved.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0121

